# Pricing

Render with the kit: `noma render examples/kit/pricing.noma --kit examples/kit/kit.noma`.
Each use below is one small block with one stable ID; the kit decides how it
looks. Change the kit and every page updates.

::grid{columns=3}
:::pricing_card{id="plan-free" plan="Free" price="$0"}
::::slot{name="features"}
- Up to 3 spaces
- Community support
::::
:::

:::pricing_card{id="plan-team" plan="Team" price="$8" period="per user / month" cta="Most teams start here." class="tone-accent"}
::::slot{name="features"}
- Unlimited spaces
- Agent proposals with proof
::::
:::

:::pricing_card{id="plan-enterprise" plan="Enterprise" price="Custom" cta="SSO, SCIM, audit export."}
::::slot{name="features"}
- EU data residency
- Legal holds
::::
:::
::

::grid{columns=2}
:::stat{id="stat-agents" value="100%" label="agent edits proofed before apply"}
:::

:::stat{id="stat-diff" value="1 block" label="touched per agent patch"}
:::
::

::feature{id="feature-source" title="Plain-text source"}
Every page is reviewable `.noma`, diffable in Git.
::
